  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a well-dressed man with a serious expression, juxtaposed with the text 'in the muslim world all gay men are well hung.' This combination is intended to perpetuate a harmful and false stereotype about gay men in the Muslim world, implying a sexualized and exaggerated physical trait. The meme uses the visual of an attractive, conventionally masculine man to reinforce the stereotype, which is rooted in Islamophobia and LGBTQ+ discrimination. The text is a generalization that targets a specific group based on sexual orientation and religious affiliation, and it promotes a harmful and offensive caricature. The overall intent is to spread prejudice and misinformation by linking a sexual stereotype with a religious group, which can contribute to discrimination and marginalization of LGBTQ+ individuals within Muslim communities and beyond.",
